{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And the sons of Judah: Er and Onan and Shelah and Perez and Zerah.</b> Scripture counts Er and Onan, who had already died, among the seventy who came down, and this is astonishing: since they had already died, how could Scripture mention them among those who came? But this matter is known by way of the Kabbalah, and it is explicitly explained in the section of Pinchas, where Scripture says: 'the sons of Judah: Er and Onan,' and 'Er and Onan died in the land of Canaan,' and then immediately appended 'and the sons of Judah were' — and this is the secret of the verse that says (Ruth 4:15): ״והיה לך למשיב נפש״, and the saying of the neighbors (there): ״יולד בן לנעמי״ — when it should have been fitting to say 'bears a son to Ruth.' And the son is this."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:20:44.209175879Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}